    "contentHTML": "\n<div class=\"learn-intro\">\n  <span class=\"learn-keyword\">Still life drawing</span> involves drawing an arrangement of inanimate objects — bottles, fruits, books, pots, cloth, and so on. It is one of the most important exercises in observational drawing, training students to observe proportion, perspective, form, and light.\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">1. What is Still Life?</h3>\n<p class=\"learn-p\">Still life is a genre of art that depicts inanimate objects arranged on a surface. Objects are chosen for their variety of shapes, textures, and sizes to create an interesting composition.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">2. Objects Commonly Used</h3>\n<ul class=\"learn-list\">\n  <li>Bottles and jugs (cylinder-based forms)</li>\n  <li>Fruits (sphere-based forms)</li>\n  <li>Bowls and cups (hemisphere and cylinder forms)</li>\n  <li>Books and boxes (cuboid forms)</li>\n  <li>Cloth and drapery (soft, irregular forms)</li>\n  <li>Vegetables and natural objects</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">3. Steps in Drawing Still Life</h3>\n<ol class=\"learn-list\">\n  <li><strong>Observe and plan:</strong> Study the arrangement. Identify the composition and main shapes.</li>\n  <li><strong>Light construction lines:</strong> Sketch the overall layout and proportions lightly.</li>\n  <li><strong>Basic shapes:</strong> Break each object into its basic geometric form.</li>\n  <li><strong>Refine outlines:</strong> Add detail to the outlines of each object.</li>\n  <li><strong>Shading:</strong> Add tonal values to create form, depth, and light direction.</li>\n  <li><strong>Details:</strong> Add texture, surface patterns, labels, and fine details.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<div class=\"learn-tip-box\">\n  <span class=\"learn-tip-icon\">💡</span>\n  <strong>Exam Tip:</strong> Still life = drawing inanimate objects. Composition, proportion, perspective, and shading are all practised in still life. Steps: observe → light construction lines → basic shapes → refine → shade → details.\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"learn-tip-box\">\n  <span class=\"learn-tip-icon\">🎯</span>\n  <strong>Summary:</strong> Still life = inanimate objects arranged for drawing. Trains: observation, proportion, basic shapes, shading. Steps: observe → construction lines → basic shapes → refine → shade → details.\n</div>\n  ",
