    "contentHTML": "\n<div class=\"learn-intro\">\n  <span class=\"learn-keyword\">Graphic advertisement</span> uses visual design to promote products, services, events, or ideas. There are many forms — from traditional print-based advertising to digital and outdoor media.\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">1. Meaning of Graphic Advertisement</h3>\n<p class=\"learn-p\">Graphic advertisement is a form of visual communication designed to inform, persuade, or remind an audience about a product, service, event, or cause through visual means.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">2. Forms of Print Advertisement</h3>\n<div class=\"learn-table-wrap\">\n  <table class=\"learn-table\">\n    <thead><tr><th>Form</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td><strong>Poster</strong></td><td>Large printed visual advertisement displayed publicly</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Flyer/Handbill</strong></td><td>Small printed sheet distributed by hand for local events or businesses</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Brochure/Leaflet</strong></td><td>Folded multi-page printed promotional material</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Newspaper/Magazine Ad</strong></td><td>Printed advertisement placed in newspapers or magazines</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Catalogue</strong></td><td>Book or booklet listing products/services with prices and descriptions</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Sticker</strong></td><td>Self-adhesive printed advertisement</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">3. Elements of Effective Advertisement</h3>\n<ul class=\"learn-list\">\n  <li><strong>Headline:</strong> Attention-grabbing title or slogan.</li>\n  <li><strong>Body copy:</strong> The main text providing details.</li>\n  <li><strong>Visual (Image):</strong> Photograph or illustration that attracts attention.</li>\n  <li><strong>Logo/Brand:</strong> Company or product identity mark.</li>\n  <li><strong>Call to action:</strong> Instruction to the audience (\"Call now\", \"Visit us today\").</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div class=\"learn-tip-box\">\n  <span class=\"learn-tip-icon\">💡</span>\n  <strong>Exam Tip:</strong> Print advertisement forms: Poster, Flyer/Handbill, Brochure/Leaflet, Newspaper ad, Catalogue, Sticker. Elements of effective ad: Headline, Body copy, Visual, Logo/Brand, Call to action.\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"learn-tip-box\">\n  <span class=\"learn-tip-icon\">🎯</span>\n  <strong>Summary:</strong> Graphic advertisement = visual communication for promotion. Forms: Poster, Flyer, Brochure, Newspaper ad, Catalogue, Sticker. Effective ads have: headline, body copy, visual, logo, call to action.\n</div>\n  ",
