    "contentHTML": "\n<div class=\"learn-intro\">\n  <span class=\"learn-keyword\">2-dimensional (2D) art</span> includes all art forms that exist on a flat surface — drawing, painting, printmaking, photography, and graphic design. Understanding the terminology used in 2D art is essential for analysing and discussing artworks.\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">1. Key 2D Art Terms</h3>\n<div class=\"learn-table-wrap\">\n  <table class=\"learn-table\">\n    <thead><tr><th>Term</th><th>Definition</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td><strong>Picture plane</strong></td><td>The flat surface of a 2D artwork (canvas, paper)</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Foreground</strong></td><td>The area of the picture closest to the viewer</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Middle ground</strong></td><td>The area between foreground and background</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Background</strong></td><td>The area furthest from the viewer</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Positive space</strong></td><td>The space occupied by the main subject(s)</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Negative space</strong></td><td>The empty space around and between subjects</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Tonal value</strong></td><td>The degree of lightness or darkness</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Perspective</strong></td><td>The technique of representing 3D depth on a flat surface</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Horizon line</strong></td><td>The eye level line in a perspective drawing</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Vanishing point</strong></td><td>The point on the horizon where parallel lines appear to converge</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"learn-tip-box\">\n  <span class=\"learn-tip-icon\">💡</span>\n  <strong>Exam Tip:</strong> 2D art is on a flat surface. Key spatial terms: foreground (closest), middle ground, background (furthest). Positive space = subject; Negative space = empty areas. Vanishing point = where parallel lines converge on horizon line. Perspective creates 3D illusion on 2D surface.\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"learn-tip-box\">\n  <span class=\"learn-tip-icon\">🎯</span>\n  <strong>Summary:</strong> 2D art = flat surface. Terms: picture plane, foreground/middle/background, positive/negative space, tonal value, perspective, horizon line, vanishing point.\n</div>\n  ",
